		<category><![CDATA[Regulation]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://cryptoslate.com/?p=585160</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>You can send crypto from MEXC to Binance, see that the transaction went through on the blockchain, and still be unable to trade with that deposit when you log in to Binance. That&#039;s what Binance told customers to expect while it reviews deposits from MEXC. Try to move money the other way, and Binance says…</p>
